  "solution": "We apply the options on the given equation & solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/0c78fc52b26774cbcf8e00ecc4b04f9af9e38f028b89d06ffbf71af3ad987cab.png] \n\nGiven Equation: 7 × 4 ÷ 14 + 12 + 30 = 50\n\nNow, Checking the options:\n\nOption 1) 12, 14\n\n7 × __**4 ÷ 12**__ + 14 + 30 = 50\n\n__**7 x 0.33**__ + 14 + 30 = 50\n\n__**2.33 + 14 + 30**__ = 50\n\n46.33 ≠ 50\n\n**Option 2) 7, 14**\n\n14 × **__4 ÷ 7__** + 12 + 30 = 50\n\n**__14 x 0.57__** + 12 + 30 = 50\n\n__**8 + 12 + 30**__ = 50\n\n**50 = 50**\n\nOption 3) 4, 7\n\n4 × **__7 ÷ 14__** + 12 + 30 = 50\n\n__**4 × 0.5**__ + 12 + 30 = 50\n\n__**2 + 12**____** + 30**__ = 50\n\n44 ≠ 50\n\nOption 4) 30, 50\n\n7 × **__4 ÷ 14__** + 12 + 50 = 30\n\n__**7 × **__**__0.28__** + 12 + 50 = 30\n\n__**2 + 12 + 50**__ = 30\n\n64 ≠ 30\n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option 2.**",
